# <type>(<scope>): <short summary, 50 chars max>
#
# Types:
#   feat     — new capability added
#   fix      — bug or error corrected
#   docs     — documentation only (README, CONTEXT, HARNESS, PROJECTS)
#   chore    — maintenance, config, housekeeping
#   ci       — GitHub Actions / pipeline changes
#   refactor — restructured, no behavior change
#
# Scopes (optional but recommended):
#   ws_<name>   — workspace-specific change
#   harness     — HARNESS.md or CONTEXT.md
#   portfolio   — PROJECTS.md or root-level files
#   mcp         — MCP server config or tooling
#   report      — Power BI report files
#   model       — semantic model / DAX
#
# Examples:
#   docs(ws_Finance_Analysis): update CONTEXT after report redesign
#   feat(ws_DS_BankChurn): add Bronze ingestion metadata logging
#   chore(harness): update HARNESS.md session protocols
#   ci: add Fabric sm_Finance refresh workflow on push to main
#
# Rules:
#   - Imperative mood: "add" not "added", "fix" not "fixed"
#   - No period at the end
#   - No quotes around the message
#   - 50 chars max on the first line